      "observed": "On the Microcontroller sheet, C14 (1uF) is in series between +3V3 and the EN/CHIP_PU node; C7 (10uF) connects that node to GND. There is no DC pull-up connection from EN/CHIP_PU to +3V3.",
      "expected": "EN/CHIP_PU should have a DC path to +3V3 (typically through a pull-up resistor), with a capacitor from EN to GND if an RC reset delay is intended.",
